{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834700/extras/d94e2bc7d4f6c187cd1d0a46661a362b.avif?t=1772867028\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834700/extras_big/d94e2bc7d4f6c187cd1d0a46661a362b.webp?t=1772867028 width=1560 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koltera 2 is a cozy incremental RPG idler where you gather resources, summon over 120 unique creatures, automate your skills with creatures, and sit back while you watch numbers go up, even while you're offline. Level up  gathering skills and workstations. Refine items, go on expeditions, and level up your creatures. Prestige your creatures by Awakening them, earning valuable rewards and bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koltera 2 is a <strong>FREE</strong> game and will <strong>NEVER\u00a0</strong>have micro-transactions. There is no form of monetization in this game. Enjoy! :)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 gathering and 3 workstations skills to level to 99</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120 unique creatures to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a skill tree with various benefits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tons of different progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >automation with creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >everything is offline-able</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 lovely achievements to achieve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >190+ items to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >free game with no MTX or DLC</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2834700/afa3e66962b4d3157d22ee104d4cd40db1cbe7db.jpg"},{"name":"Growing Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co